      "content": "1) Only students who participate in an approved study-abroad program may take INTL 151 —Cross-Cultural Training I. 2) Students may meet the Political Science major's experiential learning requirement by participating in an approved education abroad program 3) Any SABD (education abroad) course may be used to satisfy the experiential learning requirement. 4) The capstone project must be completed individually and receive a minimum grade of B+ . 5) At least one of the upper-division Political Science courses must also be from the set of Diversity courses in section K.",
